Error [E0956]: tuple literals in comptime can't run at compile time yet
  --> tests/ui/comptime_tuple.jet:1:14
    |
  1 | comptime P = (x: 1, y: 2);
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: comptime evaluates a pure subset of Jet; this construct isn't supported there yet
 Fix: compute this value at runtime, or use a simpler comptime expression
